# --- Generated test reports ---
# Every test run rewrites the traceability matrix, so committing it caused merge conflicts on
# nearly every story PR. Regenerate it with `npm run test:trace`; Backend CI uploads it as the
# `traceability-matrix` artifact on every PR.
docs/testing/TRACEABILITY.md

